# ITE IT9175 ISDB-T dongle
# TAG+="uaccess" covers a local desktop session.  A headless/SSH login gets no
# logind seat, so the uaccess ACL is never applied; GROUP="plugdev" (the Debian
# and Raspberry Pi OS group for raw USB access) covers that case.
SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="048d", ATTR{idProduct}=="275a", TAG+="uaccess", GROUP="plugdev", MODE="0660"
